# design/ is the app's design system and is committed in full, generated files
# included, so the folder renders on a fresh clone with nothing run first.
# `npm run design -- --check` is what keeps the generated copies honest.

# Scratch space for local experiments, never committed. Previously matched only
# by the `*.local` pattern above, which caught this directory by accident.
.local/
